      {
        "id": "p1",
        "label": "1",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "13 But we do not want for you to be ignorant, brothers, concerning those who are asleep,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "label": "2",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "in order that you may not grieve"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "label": "3",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "just as even the rest of mankind who do not have hope."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "label": "4",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "14 For since we believe"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "label": "5",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "that Jesus died"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "label": "6",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "and rose again,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "label": "7",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "so also will God, through Jesus Christ, bring with him those who have fallen asleep"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "label": "8",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "15 For we say this by the word of the Lord"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "label": "9",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "that we the living who remain until the coming of the Lord will in no way precede those who have fallen asleep"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "label": "10",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "16 For the Lord himself will descend from heaven with a cry of command, with the voice of an archangel and with the trumpet of God,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "label": "11",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "and the dead in Christ will rise first,"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "label": "12",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "17 then we the living who remain will be snatched up together with them in the clouds"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "label": "13",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "to meet the Lord in the air;"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "label": "14",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "and so we will always be with the Lord."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "label": "15",
        "source": {
          "kind": "raw",
          "text": "18 Therefore, encourage one another with these words."
        }
      }
    ],
